@startuml
actor Student
participant ScienceActivity
participant AskScienceQuestionUseCase as UseCase
participant ScienceHistoryRepository as History
participant ScienceAnswerService as Service
participant GeminiScienceService as Gemini
participant LocalScienceService as Local

Student -> ScienceActivity: Select Physics/Chemistry/Biology
ScienceActivity -> ScienceActivity: Switch to separate subject conversation
Student -> ScienceActivity: Send text and/or image
ScienceActivity -> ScienceActivity: Build recent same-subject context
ScienceActivity -> UseCase: execute(ScienceQuestion)
UseCase -> UseCase: validate and normalize
alt exact cached text question exists
  UseCase -> History: findCached(user, subject, level, fingerprint)
  History --> UseCase: saved answer
  UseCase --> ScienceActivity: ScienceAnswer(fromCache=true)
else no cache or image question
  UseCase -> Service: answer(question)
  alt API configured and remote succeeds
    Service -> Gemini: answer(question)
    Gemini --> Service: subject-specific answer
  else missing key/network/API failure
    Service -> Local: answer(question)
    Local --> Service: safe fallback answer
  end
  Service --> UseCase: ScienceAnswer
  UseCase -> History: save encrypted question/answer
  History --> UseCase: historyId
  UseCase --> ScienceActivity: ScienceAnswer(historyId)
end
ScienceActivity --> Student: Replace loading row with AI message
@enduml
